{"sections":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","kind":"hero","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","action":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"type":"reference"}},{"chapters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will learn how to import the OUDS iOS Swift Package and which librairies it provides","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"you should choose for your needs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies"],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will see how to instanciate a theme and inject it inside your app","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Preparation of the theme","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme"],"image":"ic_theme_intro.png"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will see how you can use your first components provided by OUDS Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Use of first components provided by OUDS","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"],"image":"ic_component_intro.png"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will use original components of OUDS and richer ones","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Richer and more original components of OUDS","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components"],"image":"ic_component_intro.png"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS is not only about components and themes. It provides view modifiers, typographies and tokens which can be used. You will learn how.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Typography, view modifiers and tokens","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things"],"image":"ic_design_token_intro.png"},{"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can have questions and issues, and there are resources online. Let’s see that together.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Go further with more ressources","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further"]}],"name":null,"image":null,"content":[],"kind":"volume"}],"metadata":{"title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","role":"overview","category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","estimatedTime":"2hr 5min"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)"},"kind":"overview","references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)":{"role":"overview","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!"}],"kind":"overview","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things":{"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","type":"topic","role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","kind":"project","estimatedTime":"30min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"title":"Styling things"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further":{"role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}],"kind":"project","estimatedTime":"10min","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","title":"Going further with more resources"},"ic_theme_intro.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_theme_intro.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"OUDS themes logo","type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_intro.png"},"ic_component_intro.png":{"alt":"Logo of OUDS","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_component_intro.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"ic_component_intro.png"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies":{"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","type":"topic","role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","kind":"project","estimatedTime":"10min","abstract":[{"text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swift Package integration"},"ic_unified_ds.png":{"alt":"Logo of OUDS","type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_unified_ds.png"}],"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png"},"ic_design_token_intro.png":{"type":"image","alt":"OUDS tokens logo","identifier":"ic_design_token_intro.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_design_token_intro.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components":{"role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use."}],"kind":"project","estimatedTime":"30min","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","title":"Use your first OUDS components"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme":{"role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything."}],"kind":"project","estimatedTime":"15min","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","title":"Instanciate and inject a theme"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components":{"role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}],"kind":"project","estimatedTime":"30min","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","title":"Add more OUDS components"}}}